{
  "text": "FAMILY WORKSPACE\nCare\nCaregivers\nMessages\nRequest care\nMB\nMaria Bennett\nFamily\nAbout Ellie\nMother\n75-84\nShe/her\nAt a glance\n\nA retired teacher who enjoys gardening, family stories, and a friendly conversation.\n\nInterests and comforts\n\nCrossword puzzles, jazz, and sitting in the garden when the weather is mild.\n\nA good visit\n\nA relaxed pace, a warm lunch, and a short walk make a good visit.\n\nCommunication\nUse short, clear sentences\nGive extra time to answer\n\nPlease introduce yourself and give Ellie time to answer.\n\nSupport and mobility\nCompanionship and conversation\nMeal preparation or eating support\nLight household help\nWalking or mobility support\n\nMobility\n\nUses an aid\n\nUses a walking cane outdoors; stay nearby on steps.\n\nRoutine and comfort\n\nUsual routine\n\nLunch around noon, followed by a short walk and a cup of tea.\n\nFood and drink\n\nPrefers soup and a sandwich. Encourage a glass of water at lunch.\n\nComfort and reassurance\n\nBenefits from reminders or reassurance\nImportant for safety\nFall risk\n\nKeep the hallway clear and remind Ellie to use the handrail.\n\nWhat the family is looking for\n\nHelpful caregiver qualities\n\nPatient\nCalm\nConversational\n\nPlease do\n\nExplain what you are doing and offer choices.\n\nContacts and care coordination\n\nFull name: Eleanor Bennett\n\nDaniel Bennett · Son\n\n+1 919 555 0153\n\ndaniel.find-care-audit@example.com\n\nContact Maria first; Daniel is the backup family contact.\n\nShared by Ellie's family · last reviewed September 7, 2026.\nEleanor Bennett · Wed, Sep 9\nFILLED\nVISIT Scheduled\nPayment Authorized\n\nOne-time care - Sep 09, 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM - Raleigh, NC\n\nVisit #1\n\nCare story\n\nVISIT SCHEDULED\n\nYour visit is scheduled.\n\nYour caregiver is booked. Check the time and address, message them if needed, or change the visit before it starts.\n\nRIGHT NOW\n\nSofia is coming on Sep 09, 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM.\n\nMessage caregiver\nChange or cancel\n\nVisit\n\nTime, location, payment\n\nCaregiver\n\nProfile, chat\n\nHelp\n\nChange or get help\n\nCare details\n\nNeeds, address, tasks\n\nBEFORE THE VISIT\n\nChange or cancel this visit\n\nUse this before caregiver check-in if the time no longer works or you need to cancel.\n\nRequest cancellation or reschedule\n\nUse this for schedule changes before the caregiver checks in.\n\nBefore check-in\nChange type\nCancel visit\nReschedule visit\nReason\nSend request\nNeed to cancel now?\n\nThis cancels the visit before caregiver check-in and releases the payment authorization when possible.\n\nCancellation reason\nCancel visit\nSupport ticket\nSubject\nCategory\nGeneral question\nThe hours look wrong\nI am worried about safety\nI need to cancel or reschedule\nPayment question\nTime correction\nDescribe issue\nCreate support ticket\nReport incident\nIncident title\nSeverity\nLow\nMedium\nHigh\nDescription\nSubmit incident\n\n© 2026 LoLo Care Inc\n\n﻿\nTerms of Service\nPrivacy Policy\nPayments & Cancellation\nCaregiver Terms\nFamily Terms\nSafety Policy\nAll Legal Documents\nSupport",
